                <head>432. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On December 13, 1963, the UN General Assembly
                    unanimously adopted Resolution 1962 (XVIII), “Declaration of Legal Principles
                    Governing the Activities of States in the Exploration and Use of Outer Space,”
                    and Resolution 1963 (XVIII), “International Cooperation in the Peaceful Uses of
                    Outer Space.” Both resolutions are printed in <hi rendition="#italic">American
                        Foreign Policy: Current Documents, 1963</hi>, pages 1087–1092.</p>
            </div>
